OL,3,GNEWSABeach motorbike race made 'as
OL,4,Aextreme as possible'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA thousand motorbike riders from all
OL,7,Faround the world have battled it out on
OL,8,Fthe sands of the North Somerset coast.
OL,10,FThis year's Weston Beach Race,
OL,11,Ffeaturing motorbike and quad-bike
OL,12,Fevents over massive sand dunes,
OL,13,Fattracted a record 70,000 spectators on
OL,14,Fthe beach at Weston-super-Mare on
OL,15,FSaturday and Sunday.
OL,17,FConrad Mewse from Somerset was
OL,18,Fvictorious in the main race, denying
OL,19,Feight-times world champion Billy Bolt
OL,20,Fhis first win at Weston.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
