OL,3,GNEWSABeach motorbike race made 'as
OL,4,Aextreme as possible'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGareth Hockey, race director, said: "We
OL,7,Fmake everything as extreme as we can
OL,8,Ffor the riders, they want the
OL,9,Fchallenge."
